<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="RUT" style="id">Ruth</book>
  <para style="h">Ruth</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ruth</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ruth</para>
  <para style="mt">Ruth</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khua ngeipi hun lai, Israel te ii kumpi a nei ma in, a ngam sungah kialpi hong tung hi. Tua ahikom Ephrath bee le phung sung pan, Judah ngam Bethlehem khua a teang Elimelech a kici pasal khat sia a zi Naomi le a tapate nii, Mahlon le Chilion taw Moab ngam ah tawmvei sung teang tu in pai hi. Tua munah a teen lai in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Elimelech hong thi hi, tuaciang Naomi sia Moab numeite Orpah le Ruth
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />a teenpui a tapate nii taw bek taang hi. Kum sawm bang zawkciang
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mahlon le Chilion zongh thi uh hi, tuaciang Naomi sia pasal ngawl ta ngawl taw taang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua zawk tawmvei ciangin, Topa in ama ii mite sia thupha pia a, an tam mama la hi ci in Naomi in za hi; tua ahikom a mote nii taw Moab ngam nusia tu in kithoai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Judah ngam zuan kik tu in amate kipan khawm tek hi, ahihang lam a pai kawmin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Naomi in amate mun ah, “Cia kik tavun a, na nute uh taw om tavun. Kei tung le a thisate tungah nong thuthiam uh bangma in Topa in no tungah hong thuthiam tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaciang Topa in no ngeal sia pasal nei kikin innkuan khat veve nei kik tu in hong siam tahen,” ci hi. Tua ahikom a vaithakna in Naomi in a mote nii namh hi, ahihang amate kap a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Heak kik ngawl tu khu hi! Nangma taw na mipuite kungah hong zui tu khu hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Ka tanute awng, na heak kik uh kul tu hi,” ci in Naomi in zo hi. “Kei taw banghangin paikhawm nuam nu ziam? Na teenpui tu in tapate vei hing kik thei lai tu hong um nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cia kik tavun, banghang ziam cile kei sia pasal nei kik tu in huai lei zo khi hi. Lam et om lai hi ci ngaisunin tu nitak mama, pasal nei in tapate nei hial leng zong,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />a khan ngak zo tu nu ziam? Hi bang taw ngualdang na teenpui tu uh kikhaksak nuam nu ziam? Hi ngawl hi, ka tanute awng, tuabang suak thei ngawl hi ci sia he nu hi. Topa in kei hong nungngat zo hi, tuaciang no atu in khuangai mama khi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amate kap tu in hong kipan leleau hi. Tua zawkciang Orpah in a to nupi a vaithakna in namh a, tuaciang cia hi. Ahihang Ruth in a thasua nuam bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ahikom Naomi in ama tungah, “Ruth awng, na unu sia a mite le a pathian kung zuan kik zo hi. Ama taw cia khawm ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahihang Ruth in, “Nang hong nusiasak heak in. Nangma taw hong paikhawmsak po ta'n. Na paina theampo ah ka pai tu a; na teenna po ah ka teang tu hi. Na mite sia keima mite hi tu a, na Pathian sia ka Pathian hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na thina po ah ka thi tu a, tua mun sia hong kiphumna mun hi tu hi. Thina ngawl buang, kei sia nang taw ka kikhen ta le Topa in daan nasiabel kei tungah hong tungsak tahen,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Naomi in Ruth sia ama taw paikhawm tu in a thin khensat zo ci in a mu ciang a pau nawn bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Bethlehem a thet dong amate paitan uh hi. Amate tua khua a thet uh ciang a khuathing bup liinglawng a, numei te in, “Hi sia Naomi hi takpi ziam?” ci in au uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama in, “Kei Naomi hong ci heak vun, Marah hong ci tavun, banghang ziam cile Vaanglianbelpa Pathian in ka nuntakna hong haksasak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hi sung ka nusiat lai in na tam mama ka nei hi, ahihang Topa in bangma ngawl taw hong ciasak kik hi. Topa Vaanglianbelpa in hong puanil zo a, ngimna hong pia zo ahiciang banghangin Naomi hong cici lai nu ziam?” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Moab mi a monu Ruth taw Naomi ii hong ciana sia tu a bang ahi hi. Bethlehem hong thet hun lai in mangtaang at hun a kipat laitak ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Naomi in a pasal Elimelech ii bangkua sung pan a hau le a thudok khat ahi Boaz a kici mealheak khat nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ni khat ni in, Ruth in Naomi munah “Lo sungah hong paisak ta'n a, naseamte kheet ansangh te va khon tong. Na hong seamsak tu mihing khat peuma mu nanak tu khi hi,” ci hi. Naomi in, “Ka tanu awng, va pai ta'n,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ahikom Ruth pai a, naseamte ii nung pan zui in, an a kheet te la hi. Ama ii sepna lo sia Boaz ii lo na hi luilam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua zawk tawm vei ciang Bethlehem panin Boaz hong theng a, naseamte paupui in, “ Topa in hong ompui tahen!” ci hi. Amate in, “ Topa in thupha hong pia tahen!” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Boaz in, naseam uk pa munah “Zia sungah numei khangmoi sia akua ziam?” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua pa in, “Ama sia Moab pan Naomi ii hong ciapui numei sia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in keima munah, naseamte nung pan zui in ansanghte a laak natu in hong ngen hi. Ama in zingsang tuung panin seam zo a, tu mahiat ma in thinglim ah tawmvei tawlnga hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Boaz in Ruth munah, “Ngaisutna khat hong piasak ta'n. Hi lo sung simngawl koima dang ah ansangh tawm heak in. Hi sungah numeite taw naseam khawm in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />amate koisungah la ci in en in, amate taw kithua in. Nang hong vawtsiat ngawl natu in ka mite thupia zo khi hi. Na dangko simin amate dipsa tuibealte sung pan tui dawn in,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ruth in a maitang lei pha dong kunsuk a Boaz tungah, “Nang a banghang kei huvau hong thinnuammaw mama ni ziam? Banghangin ngamdangmi khat tungah hong dik mama ni ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Boaz in, “Na pasal thi pan kipan na tonupi atu na sep na vawt theampo hong za siat khi hi. Na pa na nu le na ngam nusia in, na heak ngeingawl mite kawm ah teang tu in hong pai na hi sia ka he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na sepsa na vawtsa tungtaang Topa in thaman hong pia tahen. Ama ii hong pao hong dal tu in Israel te Topa Pathian na belh hu in ama in thaman kicing hong pia tahen!” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ruth in, “Topa awng, nang kei tungah hong dik mama ni hi; Kei na naseamte khat taw zong kikim zo ngawl kasap kamthiam taw nong paupui ciang ka om nuam zaw paih hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Anneak hun ciang Boaz in Ruth mun ah, “Hong pai ta'n a, anluum bek khat la in meetui sungah pap in,” ci hi. Tua ahikom ama naseamte taw hong tokhawm a, tuaciang Boaz in an em pawlkhat pia hi. Ama in a kham dong a neak zawkciang a neak vaal pawlkhat nei lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama ansangh tawm lai tu in a pai zawkciang Boaz in naseamte thupia a, “Taangvawngte a kikoina phual dong ma an lasak vun a, anlaak a tawp natu in bangma ci heak vun. Tua bek dom ngawlin taangvawngte pan pawlkhat dok vun a ama top tu in nusiat vun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua hi a Ruth in lo sungah nitak dong ansangh tawm a, tuaciang a cil ciangin kilogramme 10 dektak pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama in a anlaakte khua sungah cia pui in a tonupi a nga za lak hi. A anneak vaal teng zongh a tonupi pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Naomi in ama munah, “Hiteng theampo koisung pan kaikhawm ni ziam? Akua lo sungah naseam ni ziam? Nang hong kin pa tungah Topa in thupha pia tahen!” ci hi. Tua ahikom Ruth in Naomi munah ama sia Boaz a kici pasal khat ii lo sungah na a sep son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Naomi in, “ Topa in Boaz thupha pia tahen!” ci in au hi. “ Topa in a kamciam sia a nungta lai te le a thisate tung dong ah kholet tawntung hi.” A kampau zom lai a, “Tua pasal sia eima mealheak kuung khat hi a, ei hong kep tu vaipuak a nei khat ahi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Ruth in, “A phabel hile, ama in an laak man dong a naseamte taw ansangh tawmin hong sawl sia ahi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Naomi in Ruth mun ah, “Ahi ma hi, ka tanu awng, Boaz lo sungah tua numeite taw nasep khop tu ma phabel tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua hi a, Ruth in mangtaang le zungtaang laak teng a man dong amate taw seam khawmin an kaikhawm hi. Tuaciang ama sia a tonupi taw ma in teang khawm top hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tawmvei zawkciang Naomi in Ruth munah, “Inn tuam taw na om thei natu in pasal khat kong zonsak kul tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nangma nasep pui numeite ii Topa Boaz sia ih mealheak ahi hunlam ciamtee in. Tu in hong ngai ta'n. Nitak ciang ama in mangtaang na cil tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ahikom kibualin a, paaknamtui tawm kinoai in, tuaciang na puan phabel teng silh in. Tua zawkciang ama taang cilna ah va pai ta'n a, ahizong a neak a dawn zawk mateng tua munah na om hunlam hesak heak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama koi sungah lum ziam pha tak ciamtee in, tuaciang a mut zawkciang a puanvan hawk in a, a khuadop ah lum in. Ama in na ngamtat natu teng hong son tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ruth in, “Na ci theampo ka vawt tu hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ahikom Ruth sia ancilna munah pai in, a tonupi sawl bangin ngamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Boaz sia a neak a dawn zawkciang a om nuam hi. Ama taangvawng lomte omna ah pai in mu nuam in lum hi. Ruth hong pai vadeen a, a puanvan hawkin ama khuadop ah lum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zan lai in Boaz thakhatin hong khanglo in, kilumheak a, numei khat a khuadop ah a lum mu in lamdang sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Nang akua ni ziam?” ci in dongh hi. “Ruth khi hi, Topa awng. Nang sia mealheak kuung khat na hi ciang kei nong et tu vaipuak nei ni hi. Nong hesuakna in hong teenpui ta'n,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“ Topa in nang thupha hong pia tahen. Na tonupi atu na sepna sa te sangin, tu in na ngamtatna taw ih bangkua sungah na thumaanna lian zaw lai hi. A hau a zawng tangval khat po zong thei na hi hang tuabangin zong ngawl ni hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ruth awng tu in, na thinngim heak in. Nong nget theampo vawt tu khi hi; khua sungah a om a kuama theampo in nang sia numei pha khat na hi sia hong he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kei sia na mealheak kuung khat hi a, nang tungah vaipuak kong nei na in a maan thu hi, ahihang kei sangin a kuung zaw mealheak pasal khat om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hi sungah zankhuateakin om vet in a, zingsang ciangin tua pa in nang vaipuak hong la tu ziam, hong la ngawl tu ziam ih en tu hi. Vaipuak hong la tu ahile a dik a pha hi, hong la bua ahile a nungta Topa tungah kiciamna vawt hi tong, keima in vaipuak la tu khi hi. Tu in hi sungah zingsang ciang dong lum po in,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ahikom ama in Boaz ii khuadop ah lum top hi, ahizong ama a kimu ngawl natu in khuavak mahiat in tho hi, banghang ziam cile Boaz in ama tualai ah a om sia kuama in a hesak nuam bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Boaz in ama munah, “Na puantual suut in a, hi sungah pha in,” ci hi. Ama in tuabangin pha a, Boaz in mangtaang kilogramme 20 dektak sun hi, tuaciang a liang ah a puak tu in suanh hi. Tua zawkciang khua sungah a vanh taw ama heak kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Inn a thet ciang a tonupi in, “Bangbang nong hi ziam? ka tanu awng,” ci in dongh hi. Ruth in Boaz ii ama atu in, a sep a vawtsak theampo son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A son lai na pan, “Nangma kungah khut hawm nguakin kong cia ngawl natu in hi mangtaang teng zongh hong pia hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Naomi in ama mun ah, “Tu in na thin sausak in, Ruth awng, hi thu teng koibang ciang hong theng tu ziam na mu dong ngak in. Boaz sia tuni in hi thu a thian mateng om thong ngawl tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Boaz sia a khua kongpi ah pai in tua kikhopna munah to hi. Tua zawkciang Elimelech ii mealheak naihuaibel, Boaz ii son sia pa hong pai hi, Boaz in ama sam in, “Hi sungah hong pai ta'n, ka lawm pa awng, hong to ta'n,” ci hi. Tuasia ciang ama pai in to hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Boaz in a khua lampuite sawm zongh samin tua mun ma ah to a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate a tosak zawkciang a mealheak pa munah, “Tu in Naomi sia Moab panin hong ciakik a, ih beepa Elimelech neisa a lo sia ama in zuak nuam hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />tuaciang hi thu na heak uh kul ka sa hi. Na dei le hi sungah a to mite mai ah lei in. Ahi hang na dei buale lei nuam bong ci in, banghang ziam cile lei thei natu thu a nei masabel sia nang hi a, tua zawkciang kei hi pheang khi hi,” ci hi. Tua pa in, “Tuasia lei tu khi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Boaz in, “Pha mama hi, ahizong Naomi kung panin lo na lei le, Moab meingong nu Ruth zongh a lei suak tu ni hi, tuasia ciang bekin a lo sia mithi pa ii bangkua sungah om tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua pasal pa in, “Tuabang thu ahile lo lei theina ka thuneina sia thasua tong, banghang ziam cile ka tate in tua lo lua thei ngawl tu uh hi. Nangma lei in, tuasia kei lei bua zaw tong,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua hunlai in, sum kizuak kilei na ahizong, vanh kithena ahizong, kipsak na tu in a zuak pa in peangdap suut in a lei pa tungah a piak sia a ngeina hi. Israel te in hi bangin thukip thukho suaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ahikom pasal pa in Boaz mun ah, “Tuasia nangma lei in,” a ci ciang, a peangdap suutin Boaz pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Boaz in lampuite le a om dangte mun ah, “No sia tu ni in Elimelech le a tapate Chilion le Mahlon ii neisa theampo Naomi tung pan ka leina tetti hi siat nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua bek dom ngawlin Mahlon zi meingong nu Moab mi Ruth sia keima zi suak hi. Hi sia in mithi pa bangkua sungah a neisa teng kip tu hi, ama ii innkuan khang zongh a mite sung le a khua sungah kizom tan tu hi. No teng sia hi thu huvau in tetti hi siat nu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lampuite le a dangte in, “Hi hi, tetti te hi khu hi. Topa in na zi sia Jacob atu ta tam mama a piangsak Rachel le Leah bang hong hisak tahen. Ephrath bee le ngui sungah hau in Bethlehem khua sungah na minthang tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa ii hi nupi khangmoi tung pan hong piak tu tate sia Judah le Tamar tapa Perez bangkua bang hong hisak tahen,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ahikom Boaz in Ruth sia a zi tu in ciapui hi. Topa in Ruth thupha pia a, nau hong paai in, tapa khat hong hing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Numei te in Naomi tung ah, “ Topa pok in! Ama in nang hong en kik tu tupa khat tuni hong pia hi. Hi patang sia Israel ah minthang tahen!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na monu in nang hong it hi, tuaciang ama in tapa sali sang zongin nang atu tam hong sepsak zo zaw hi. Tuaciang tu in ama in tupa khat hong pia a, tua pa in nang atu nuntakna thak le na huai ciang ngam muanna hong pia tu hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Naomi in nau sia la in toai bikbek a, pha takin omh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Innpaam nupi te in tua pano min sia Obed phuak uh hi. Amate in ngual mun theampo ah, “Naomi in tapa khat hong nei hi!,” ci uh hi. Obed sia Jesse ii pa suak a, Jesse sia David ii pa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hiteng sia Perez pan David dong khangsimna ahi hi: Perez, Hezron, Ram, Amminadab, Nahshon, Salmon, Boaz, Obed, Jesse, David ahi hi.
  </para>
</usx>
